<PubmedArticle>
                <AbstractText Label="CONCLUSIONS" NlmCategory="CONCLUSIONS">For adequate patient counseling, knowledge of predictive values of multiparametric magnetic resonance imaging for extraprostatic extension is of utmost importance. High negative predictive value, important for decisions on nerve sparing strategies at radical prostatectomy, is only reached in low risk subjects.</AbstractText>
